OL,3,GNEWSATractor parade fears fake Facebook
OL,4,Apage scams
OL,5,
OL,6,FA charity event organiser says Facebook
OL,7,Fneeds to do more to protect its
OL,8,Fsupporters from fake online profiles
OL,9,Fthat have been set up for a third year
OL,10,Frunning.
OL,12,FThe Suffolk Tractor Light Parade will
OL,13,Fsee about 200 vehicles travel around
OL,14,Fthe east of the county on 13 December.
OL,16,FAs in 2024 and 2025, Facebook pages
OL,17,Fposing as the official event were set
OL,18,Fup, and the genuine organisers feared
OL,19,Fsupporters could be asked to donate to
OL,20,Fscam accounts.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,380,370,200,160,0,100
