OL,3,GNEWSATractor parade fears fake Facebook
OL,4,Apage scams
OL,5,
OL,6,FOrganiser Liz Quickenden said she had
OL,7,Frepeatedly reported the issue to
OL,8,FFacebook owner Meta, but had been told
OL,9,Fits guidelines had not been violated.
OL,10,FAfter being contacted by the BBC Meta
OL,11,Facknowledged the pages had violated
OL,12,Fpolicies and removed them.
